---
description: Select the exact owned launch identity and requested work without inventing a patch.
args:
  goal: string
  index: LaunchIndex
returns: LaunchSelection | null
---
Select the active owned panel that the user means, preserving its exact indexed identity. A similarly titled archive is a different object. Classify inspection, an authorized change, or an explicitly requested disposable validation experiment. Decide whether the user asks for a retained private note or handoff; private verification alone does not require a new retained artifact. Return null if the intended owned identity is genuinely ambiguous or unavailable. This selection supplies no state values, patch, authority, or evidence of an effect.
